      "name": "[Blueprint][Magus] Blade Hone Emblem Casting - Lv.60",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of the Orphie & Magus exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Obtainable through Investigation Exploration or purchasable from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Season Limited.\nItem Effect: After unleashing \"Power Slash\" on a Boss-Rank enemy, summons a phantom of \"Scorpse\" to attack the enemy. Can be triggered once every 60s (this is not considered a use of \"Etheric Phantom,\" and it cannot be triggered while \"Etheric Phantom: Scorpse\" is on the field). When using <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>, the ATK of all squad members increases by 15% for 30s. Repeated triggers refresh the duration.\n<color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> CRIT DMG increases by 85%, and the <color=#FFFFFF>[Quick Assist]</color> triggered after launching <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Heat Charge]</color> will be replaced with a <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color>.",
